            "sizeguide_type": "page",
            "sizeguide_page": "size-guide",
            "sizeguide_content": "<h4>General Men’s Polo & Apparel Size Chart (Inches)</h4><ul><li><strong>Small (S):</strong> Chest 36\"–38\" | Length ~27\"</li><li><strong>Medium (M):</strong> Chest 39\"–41\" | Length ~28\"</li><li><strong>Large (L):</strong> Chest 42\"–44\" | Length ~29\"</li><li><strong>Extra Large (XL):</strong> Chest 45\"–47\" | Length ~30\"</li><li><strong>2XL (XXL):</strong> Chest 48\"–50\" | Length ~30.5\"–31\"</li></ul>",
